WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Who is your best friend?

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,640
Who wants to cheer with you?

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,720
Charlie is also angry

4
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,680
You are just an orphan without parents

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,480
It's just something that was born but not raised by a mother.

6
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,320
God takes pity on you and makes you look better

7
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,400
You're still proud of yourself

8
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,400
Your appearance is beautiful

9
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,080
In fact, it’s not clean at all behind the scenes.

10
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:16,200
How do you get your tuition and living expenses as an orphan?

11
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,760
Even though I know you have subsidies

12
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,680
But I just need to add more gas and speed up

13
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:21,120
Of course you are not clean

14
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,120
Daughter Su, let me tell you

15
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,480
If it weren't for the sake of flirting with men

16
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,760
Who will be your best friend?

17
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,440
Just starve to death on the Chaos Star.

18
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:30,600
Xuanxuan, please stop laughing at me

19
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,080
After all, we are also roommates.

20
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:33,960
一一Xuanxuan

21
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:35,320
What's going on with you two?

22
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,280
How could you treat our smiling flower like this?

23
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,320
Let’s follow the laughing flowers

24
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:39,960
But I’ve had several meals

25
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,960
How bad is it for you to stab someone in the back like this?

26
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,960
Unlike me, I've already been stabbed
